# Kokosh agent — environment reference.
#
# Copy to .env.local for development (git-ignored). Every variable is optional; what changes
# is which degraded mode you land in, and each one is reported at startup and on /healthz.
#
# Nothing here is a real credential.

# --- /audit payments -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Both required to charge for /audit. With neither set, /audit answers 503
# (payment_not_configured) rather than serving the paid report for free.
CDP_API_KEY_ID=
CDP_API_KEY_SECRET=

# Serve /audit free on purpose, without CDP credentials. Explicit opt-in: this is how you
# say "free is intended" rather than having a missing key silently mean the same thing.
# ALLOW_UNPAID_AUDIT=1

# --- Sign In With Base -----------------------------------------------------------------
# HMAC key for sign-in nonces. MUST be identical across every instance — a per-instance
# secret means a nonce issued by one instance is rejected by another. Unset falls back to a
# per-process random value, which reproduces exactly that bug, so it warns at startup.
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
SIWB_NONCE_SECRET=

# Nonce lifetime in seconds (default 300). Short by design: it bounds replay wherever the
# nonce store cannot.
# SIWB_NONCE_TTL=300

# --- Nonce single-use store ------------------------------------------------------------
# Vercel KV. Both required; with only one set the agent falls back to per-process memory,
# which cannot see nonces spent on other instances. Vercel injects these automatically once
# a KV store is linked to the project.
KV_REST_API_URL=
KV_REST_API_TOKEN=

# --- Sentinel (scripts/sentinel-run.mjs) -----------------------------------------------
# Run the full scan without attesting on-chain or advancing the state file.
# DRY_RUN=1

# Blocks per eth_getLogs window. Must stay under 10000 — Base rejects wider ranges (-32614).
# MAX_LOG_RANGE=9500

# Pause between windows, milliseconds. Raise if the public RPC rate-limits.
# WINDOW_DELAY_MS=250

# --- Sentinel cron (scripts/sentinel-cron.sh) ------------------------------------------
# MAX_JITTER_SECONDS=2700
# STAND_DOWN_PCT=40
# MAX_ACTIONS_PER_DAY=2
